35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The delivery windows for scanning equipment are unreliable, but road closures are manageable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Bus links are gone in outer wards, but evening room bookings are full, showing high demand.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The grant only covers twelve months, and vehicle costs overran last year. This is risky.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"Former outreach stops had high attendance, but the digitisation project from six years ago failed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We have volunteers for repair, but no one is trained to supervise outside facilitators.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if the grant expires, can we sustain a mobile service with current budgets?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, the high attendance at outreach stops suggests a mobile branch might be very popular.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, the vehicle overrun is a major concern. We need to be careful with mobile options.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Yumi, yes, the data supports a mobile service, but we must ensure it is sustainable.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@George, the lack of supervision training is a problem for any program needing external help.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The mobile service faces road closure risks, but the demand seems high based on Yumi's data.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"The mobile service could reach those without bus links, which is a huge gap we are missing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,I am still worried about the long-term funding. The grant terms are not ideal for this.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"The past failure of digitisation doesn't mean mobile will fail, especially with high attendance history.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,We need to ensure we have the staff to run the mobile service effectively.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
